# Livewire (optional)

Copy this rule into the app's `.cursor/rules/` only when Livewire is installed. Skip for API-only apps.

Follow the Livewire major version already in `composer.lock`. Prefer Boost `livewire-development` in the app when Boost installed it.

**Do:** authorize inside the component action; validate with rules already used in sibling components; keep N+1 out of `render()`.

**Don't:** persist raw request arrays onto models; put secrets in public component properties; add Volt unless the app already uses it.
